  "interpretation": [
    "All 165 native worlds complete after the 207-control safety gate. Full independent replay verifies 19,965 controller decisions and 99,825 native samples. Numerical matching and repeated-action dispersion pass, so this is a valid negative comparison rather than the v1 prefix refusal.",
    "Action ordering is correct for 33/87, 41/87 and 34/66 distinguishable pairs on seed 6119, corner 000 and seed 14172. All three bodies miss the unchanged 70 percent requirement and .01 rad/s maximum-regret limit. The predicted choice is worse than the unchanged action in every one of the nine groups.",
    "The native experiment applies every assigned action independently, not the predicted winner. It observes bounded alternatives without adopting a model-selected controller. No short diagnostic world recovers or acquires upright dwell; none violates a joint limit.",
    "Exposed contact-free diagnosis isolates two omissions from the predictor: .01 kg m2 joint armature present in the native XML and implicit velocity-actuator integration. Either change alone leaves an error. Both together reduce maximum joint-speed error from 10.1225 rad/s to 7.484e-8 rad/s across the 54 initial samples; motor forces already agree within 2.981e-8 Nm.",
    "The actuator diagnosis uses retained samples after seeing the failed comparison and no parameter fitting. It identifies a concrete successor change, not prospective accuracy, contact-response validation, recovery, learning or a revised v2 pass. The original predictor, thresholds and all native outcomes remain immutable."
  ],
  "next_gate": "Implement a distinct actuator-aware response successor that binds ordered native joint armature and the implicit velocity-actuator derivative, including force saturation and passive damping. Preserve v1/v2 observations and the original predictor behavior for historical replay. Use analytical controls and exposed retained-state comparisons, including contacts, before a fresh declared action-ordering comparison from a clean pushed freeze. Require useful ranking before broad factored recovery search and fresh full-capture confirmation of diverse leads; do not repeat the unchanged model or foot-only grid.",
